{"html":"\n  \u003cdiv class=\"page-inner flex flex-col justify-between\">\n    \u003cheader class=\"mast\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"brand\">\n        \u003cstrong>AlpacaNotes\u003c/strong>\n        \u003cspan class=\"kicker\">PART 04 · 蕴含织物与相对论效应\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"masttime font-mono text-xs\">\n        \u003cspan>PROPOSITION 4.2 · 因果流程 · PAGE 13 / 20\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"pb-2.5 border-b-2 border-ink dark:border-neutral-700\">\n      \u003ch2 class=\"ed-page-title font-serif text-[34px] font-black text-ink dark:text-white leading-tight\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-accent font-mono mr-3\">[4.2]\u003c/span>连续流形与刚体运动\n      \u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 pl-3.5 border-l-4 border-accent mt-2\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0 bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">核心论断\u003c/span>\n        \u003cp class=\"ed-thesis-text font-serif text-[21px] text-ink dark:text-neutral-200 font-semibold leading-snug\">\n          海量 Emes 粗粒化诱发连续元数学流形，支撑概念跨领域刚体迁移。\n        \u003c/p>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-main ed-layout-seq ed-seq-3 flex items-center my-auto h-[600px]\">\n      \n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-card flex-1 card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[590px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#1b4f72;\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[13px] font-mono font-extrabold tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded\" style=\"background:#1b4f7216; color:#1b4f72;\">STEP 01\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">STAGE 1/3\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n              流体动力学极限\n            \u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n              \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">受限带宽粗粒化\u003c/strong>：观察者无法追踪分子级代换，必然感知为连续高维流形。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">宏观概念级推导\u003c/strong>：在流体动力学层级运筹定理，免于陷入微观符号泥潭。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 340 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cg fill=\"#64748b\">\u003ccircle cx=\"45\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\"/>\u003ccircle cx=\"70\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3\"/>\u003ccircle cx=\"55\" cy=\"75\" r=\"3\"/>\u003ccircle cx=\"85\" cy=\"42\" r=\"3\"/>\u003ccircle cx=\"95\" cy=\"72\" r=\"3\"/>\u003c/g>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M120 58 L160 58\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M180 75 Q240 20 300 65\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"240\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\">连续光滑高维流形\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#1b4f7216; color:#1b4f72;\">通俗类比\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>正如离散像素远看聚成高清平滑画面。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-arrow flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-7 text-accent/60\">\n              \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-2xl\">\u003c/i>\n            \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-card flex-1 card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[590px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#0284c7;\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[13px] font-mono font-extrabold tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded\" style=\"background:#0284c716; color:#0284c7;\">STEP 02\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">STAGE 2/3\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n              概念刚体平移\n            \u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n              \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">统计均匀性支撑\u003c/strong>：空间在计算不可约性搅拌下呈现高度的统计均匀性。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">跨分支不撕裂\u003c/strong>：概念群可如刚体般跨领域迁移而不被底层涨落撕碎。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 340 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpolygon points=\"55,80 85,35 115,80\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M135 58 L205 58\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n          \u003cpolygon points=\"225,80 255,35 285,80\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"170\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0284c7\">概念群跨分支刚体平移\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#0284c716; color:#0284c7;\">通俗类比\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>就像水波向前传播，水分子在变但波形不变。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n            \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-arrow flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-7 text-accent/60\">\n              \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-2xl\">\u003c/i>\n            \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-seq-card flex-1 card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[590px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#b45309;\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[13px] font-mono font-extrabold tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded\" style=\"background:#b4530916; color:#b45309;\">STEP 03\u003c/span>\n              \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">STAGE 3/3\u003c/span>\n            \u003c/div>\n            \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n              宏观测地线桥梁\n            \u003c/h3>\n            \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n              \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">计算通用连通性\u003c/strong>：由计算等价性原理支撑，主流公理体系整体高度连通。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">高阶分支统一\u003c/strong>：数学家可沿平滑测地线跨越分支，实现朗兰兹式统一。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n            \u003c/ul>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 340 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"65\" cy=\"78\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#d97706\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"65\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d97706\">数论\u003c/text>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"275\" cy=\"78\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#0d9488\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#0d9488\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"275\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0d9488\">几何\u003c/text>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M80 65 Q170 12 260 65\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"170\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\">宏观测地线桥梁\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#b4530916; color:#b45309;\">示例\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>用高阶概念桥直连数论与几何，免写底层代码。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-bottom-bar pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-wrap flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-600 rounded-r-md max-w-5xl\">\n        \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600 text-base shrink-0\">\u003c/i>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-text text-[20px] leading-tight text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 font-sans\">\n          \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">本节要旨：\u003c/strong>\u003cspan>粗粒化将离散代换投影为连续流形，赋予高阶概念跨界稳定性。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"folio font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 shrink-0\">\n        \u003cspan>Stephen Wolfram · The Physicalization of Metamathematics\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n"}